{"full":"soaring-xiongkulu/easyaiot","name":"easyaiot","description":"我希望全世界都能使用这个系统，实现AI的真正0门槛，人人都能体验到AI带来的好处，而并不只是掌握在少数人手里。支持上千种垂直场景，支持AI模型定制化和AI算法定制化开发 深度融合，赋能万物智视：EasyAIoT 构筑了物联网设备（尤其是海量摄像头）的高效接入与管控网络。我们深度融合流媒体实时传输技术与前沿人工智能（AI），打造一体化服务核心。这套方案不仅打通了异构设备的互联互通，更将高清视频流与强大的AI解析引擎深度集成，赋予监控系统“智能之眼”——精准实现人脸识别、异常行为分析、风险人员布控周界入侵检测。","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":735,"forks":230,"created":"2025-08-04T02:21:28Z","updated":"2026-09-24T06:58:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"http://36.111.47.113:8888/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T05:11:07.086Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T05:11:07.086Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T05:11:07.086Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:25:48.183Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:20.225Z","stars":734,"forks":229},{"at":"2026-10-04T05:48:43.978Z","stars":734,"forks":229},{"at":"2026-10-05T05:11:07.086Z","stars":735,"forks":230}],"technologies":["Python"],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:15:49.141Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["My vision is for this system to be accessible worldwide, achieving truly zero barriers to AI. Everyone should experience the benefits of AI, not just a privileged few."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/soaring-xiongkulu/easyaiot/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1de92b78c87804a4b1f73a9ad6f42463404b5e846bf02192d5581dd660885110","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:28:08.457Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:15:58.441Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-24T06:58:37Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"My vision is for this system to be accessible worldwide, achieving truly zero barriers to AI. Everyone should experience the benefits of AI, not just a privileged few.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/soaring-xiongkulu/easyaiot/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"On the capability side, the platf