r system integrators and solution providers: Eliminates front-end reskinning, custom development, and release cycles; switch branding quickly between PoC demos and production delivery, reuse one codebase across multiple customers, shorten payment cycles, and improve solution reuse For government, campus, hospital, and other end users: Login page, command dashboard, and daily…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/soaring-xiongkulu/easyaiot/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Develop in the browser: VS Code–style online IDE on code-server; clones the full EasyAIoT repo by default—contributors can edit, run module-level checks, and open PRs without setting up a local toolchain first Standalone portal and multi-user: Ops console on :9300, decoupled from the WEB admin; one Docker workspace per person; port pool 13338–13437 for concurrent users;…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/soaring-xiongkulu/easyaiot/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"1de92b78c87804a4b1f73a9ad6f42463404b5e846bf02192d5581dd660885110","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/soaring-xiongkulu/easyaiot/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:15:58.444Z"},"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:50.143Z","latestRelease":{"name":"V201.1.0","tag":"V201.1.0","publishedAt":"2026-09-24T06:58:16Z","url":"https://github.com/soaring-xiongkulu/easyaiot/releases/tag/V201.1.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:50.143Z","screenshots":[{"src":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/soaring-xiongkulu/easyaiot/main/.image/%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF.png","kind":"readme","alt":"Application Scenarios.png"},{"src":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/soaring-xiongkulu/easyaiot/main/.image/banner/banner1188.png","kind":"readme","alt":"Preview"},{"src":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/soaring-xiongkulu/easyaiot/main/.image/banner/banner1146.jpg","kind":"readme","alt":"Preview"},{"src":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/soaring-xiongkulu/easyaiot/main/.image/banner/banner1104.png","kind":